    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Every Data Map filename now has the standard file-location button. It reveals a prepared original file, a shared folder for grouped or duplicate names, or the named installed source archive. Missing files show an error; this does not extract arbitrary archive members. I fixed RDR1 archive-member paths during the audit and verified the real content.rpf location. Hidden checks confirmed the buttons and their desktop requests in FF8, RDR1, and RDR2.\r\n\r\nRDR2 source-file banners are also removed from the regular editing pages; that information stays in Data Map.",
